Story Title:
Implement YAML Schema Validation Framework for DSF Configuration Processing

Description:
Implement a configurable YAML validation framework in DSF Java application to validate entity configuration YAML files before JSON generation and T24 onboarding processing.

Scope:
- Validate YAML structure and field values using JSON schema
- Support application-wise modular schemas
- Externalize application-schema mapping via YAML configuration
- Aggregate validation errors across all applications
- Generate HTML validation report for both success and failure scenarios
- Stop JSON generation if validation errors exist
- Support future business-rule validation extension

Applications in scope:
- PP.COMPANY.PROPERTIES
- PP.BANK.CONDITIONS
- CURRENCY

Acceptance Criteria:
- YAML validation executes before JSON generation
- All validation errors are collected and reported in single execution
- HTML report generated for every execution
- No hardcoded switch-case for application-schema mapping
- JSON generation proceeds only if validation succeeds